{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792383780, "covers_from": "2026-10-19T04:23:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-19T04:24:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792383840, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-19T04:23:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 57676, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "臺北市部分公車未停靠於公車站指定區域，而停在站外，導致乘客下車時容易與旁側機車發生衝突，恐有碰撞危險", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.57,676", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T04:23:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44557, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "我家對面公園入口天天有人抽菸，菸會往上飄進屋內，對於不抽菸的人真的很痛苦！我們有拒吸二手菸的權利！", "display_name": "北投代表 No.44,557", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T04:23:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25467, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "柯屁第一次選說要改善計程車亂象，12年了。一樣亂沒有變好只有我變老了", "display_name": "信義代表 No.25,467", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T04:23:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 52887, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "教育", "content": "我覺得蘇巧慧的教育政策很具體很可以參考，兩位台北市長加油了。", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.52,887", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T04:23:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 6947, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "公車司機開很快煞車很急，看到老人家跌倒，很心疼", "display_name": "大安代表 No.6,947", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 44557, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.44,557", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 25467, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.25,467", "district": "xinyi",